  "full_response_text": "ChartHop is \n\nan organizational intelligence company\n\n that provides a people operations platform for HR and workforce management.\n\n\n\nThe platform connects your people and business data from any source into a living model of your whole organization\n\n, enabling companies to make better decisions about their workforce. \n\nChartHop connects people and business data, from the systems a company already runs, into a living model of the whole organization: people, work, finance, revenue and operations\n\n.\n\nKey features include:\n\n- **Visual org charts and analytics**: \n\nChartHop connects and visualizes all your people data to empower your organization through insights, alignment, and action\n\n\n\n- **Workforce planning**: \n\nInstead of having to create pivot tables in Excel, executives can use ChartHop to map out the impact of proposed headcount changes across their whole organization\n\n\n\n- **Comprehensive HR tools**: \n\nChartHop includes an HRIS along with headcount planning, compensation, performance, engagement and goals\n\n\n\n- **AI capabilities**: \n\nAsk ChartHop, ChartHop's AI assistant, is used daily to build dashboards, answer executive questions in the meeting and model org changes\n\n\n\nThe platform integrates with over 100 existing systems including payroll, HRIS, ATS, CRM, and finance tools, allowing companies to centralize their people data without switching their existing software.",
